          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayer plutôt le réseau de démo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Bluetooth on to reach your radio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active le Bluetooth pour joindre ta radio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn your radio on and keep it close to the phone. Stock MeshCore companion firmware: nothing to flash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allume ta radio et garde-la près du téléphone. Firmware MeshCore companion stock : rien à flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the 24 words of the identity to restore, separated by spaces. It replaces the identity on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape les 24 mots de l'identité à restaurer, séparés par des espaces. Elle remplace l'identité de ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown contact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact inconnu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Groupe inconnu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported content (type %@, %@ bytes)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contenu non pris en charge (type %@, %@ octets)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verified keys, nothing in clear on the air.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clés vérifiées, rien en clair sur les ondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice message (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Message vocal (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for sender keys": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sender keys en attente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the acknowledgement": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de l'ACK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your position": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de ta position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui sera envoyé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When someone sends an SOS, follow it from here: bearing and distance from your position.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand quelqu'un envoie un SOS, suis-le d'ici : cap et distance depuis ta position."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you pair, iOS asks for the 6 digits shown on the radio's screen: type them in its prompt. The radio then stays paired with this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l'appairage, iOS demande les 6 chiffres affichés sur l'écran de la radio : saisis-les dans sa fenêtre. La radio reste ensuite appairée à ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the Internet bridge (L7).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec le pont Internet (L7)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a backup, losing this phone means losing your identity and your verified contacts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans sauvegarde, perdre ce téléphone, c'est perdre ton identité et tes contacts vérifiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write these 24 words on paper, in order, and keep them somewhere safe. Anyone who has them can be you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écris ces 24 mots sur papier, dans l'ordre, et garde-les en lieu sûr. Qui les a peut se faire passer pour toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You scanned their code in person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as scanné son code en personne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your code carries your radio's address, so people can reach you.": {
      "localizations": {
